WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.370 --> 00:00:08.370
Do you know where you are right now?

00:00:09.309 --> 00:00:11.309
I'm in a drug trial.

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:13.800
What do you think is wrong with you?

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:17.160
I'm sick... and I don't matter.

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:21.320
What would you say this trial is showing you about yourself?

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:22.480
Is this therapy now?

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:24.060
It's not therapy.

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:26.560
It's science.

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:35.300
Once you begin to appreciate the structure of the mind,

00:00:36.790 --> 00:00:39.569
there's no reason to believe that anything about us can't be changed.

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:43.350
Pain can be destroyed.

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:47.380
The mind can be solved.

00:00:54.440 --> 00:00:57.560
How many of your subjects have ended up catatonic?

00:00:57.580 --> 00:00:59.560
Zero... roughly.

00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:06.540
My head doesn't work right. I thought maybe these people could fix me.

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:08.360
Sounds stupid.

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:10.360
That doesn't sound stupid to me.

00:01:10.440 --> 00:01:12.440
Okay people, let's begin.

00:01:12.560 --> 00:01:18.080
In five, four, three, two, one.

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:24.600
My mind is playing tricks.

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:39.820
This is some multi reality brain magic shit.

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:42.880
I don't know what's real and what's not.

00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:52.900
Something's wrong. What did you do?

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:54.600
Come on, wake up!

00:01:55.640 --> 00:01:58.660
Every time I separate them they just find their way back together.

00:01:59.920 --> 00:02:02.920
You are not protecting those people in there!

